OL,3,GNEWSA'School wasn't for me but further
OL,4,Aeducation suited me,' says student, as
OL,5,Athousands of places cut
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a statement, a Belfast Metropolitan
OL,8,FCollege (BMC) spokesperson said that
OL,9,Fthe deadlock over a Stormont budget was
OL,10,Fpartially responsible. The executive
OL,11,Fhas been unable to agree a budget and
OL,12,Fhas appealed to the government for more
OL,13,Fmoney.
OL,15,FLuke McCosker dropped out of doing
OL,16,FA-Levels at school because the
OL,17,Fenvironment was "not for me" but
OL,18,Fthrived at North West Regional College,
OL,19,Fwhere he did a two-year course in
OL,20,Fapplied science.
